- Augustine's privation, inward assistance and original-sin arguments remain attributed, with fictional cases kept distinct from historical evidence. Aquinas's fire and tool examples have real primary-text counterparts and their limits remain visible. [Aquinas I q.49](https://www.newadvent.org/summa/1049.htm), [Aquinas III q.62](https://www.newadvent.org/summa/4062.htm).
