- Chapter 11's bodily/beneficial reception distinction and Marburg's bounded agreement check against the respective sources. [Large Catechism V](https://bookofconcord.org/large-catechism/sacrament-of-the-altar/), [Marburg Articles](https://germanhistorydocs.org/en/from-the-reformations-to-the-thirty-years-war-1500-1648/ghdi:document-4311).
