- All seven brief Bible/Aquinas excerpts were checked for wording and attribution. The John 17 omission is marked. Zwingli's ring is genuinely his example, not an invented biographical event. [Zwingli, Third Article](https://www.uecf.net/books/zwingli-and-bullinger/chapter5.html).
